Date: Sun, 31 May 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Bypass Monotype invalid font validation

Mirror the LSPosed Monotype hook by making
SecDisplayUtils.isInvalidFont(Context, String) return false.

diff --git a/smali_classes3/com/samsung/android/settings/display/SecDisplayUtils.smali b/smali_classes3/com/samsung/android/settings/display/SecDisplayUtils.smali
index 1111111..2222222 100644
--- a/smali_classes3/com/samsung/android/settings/display/SecDisplayUtils.smali
+++ b/smali_classes3/com/samsung/android/settings/display/SecDisplayUtils.smali
@@ -5440,6 +5440,10 @@
 .method public static isInvalidFont(Landroid/content/Context;Ljava/lang/String;)Z
     .locals 9

+    const/4 v0, 0x0
+
+    return v0
+
     const-string v0, "Check if it\'s invalid :"

     const-string v1, "SecDisplayUtils"
